rectly onto any paper surface, canvas, or drawing medium. You create real, physical artwork that you can keep, frame, or gift.<\/p>","faq_3_question":"What materials do I need?","faq_3_answer":"<p>You'll need the Flowlines device, paper or canvas, and your choice of drawing tools (pencils, markers, paints, etc.). We also offer starter bundles with everything included.<\/p>","faq_4_question":"Can kids use it?","faq_4_answer":"<p>Absolutely! Flowlines is perfect for kids aged 6 and up. It's a fun, educational way to develop creativity, fine motor skills, and confidence in art.<\/p>","faq_5_question":"Is this an AI image generator?","faq_5_answer":"<p>No, Flowlines is not an AI generator. It's a smart projection tool that helps you create real, hand-drawn artwork. You're the artist—Flowlines just guides you.<\/p>","faq_6_question":"When will Flowlines be available?","faq_6_answer":"<p>Flowlines is currently in beta testing. We're planning to launch publicly in Q3 2026. Join our waitlist to be notified when pre-orders open!<\/p>","faq_7_question":"Can I join as an early tester?","faq_7_answer":"<p>Yes! We're accepting applications for our beta testing program. Early testers get exclusive access, special pricing, and the chance to shape the final product. Join the waitlist to apply for beta access.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","desktop_width_percent":100,"content_max_width":800,"section_padding":60,"item_spacing":12,"background_color":"{{ settings.color_palette.background }}","heading_color":"#000000","subheading_color":"#666666","item_background_color":"#ffffff","item_hover_color":"#f9f9f9","item_border_color":"#e0e0e0","question_color":"#000000","answer_color":"#333333","icon_color":"#000000","heading_size":32,"subheading_size":16,"question_size":16,"answer_size":14,"item_border_width":1,"item_border_radius":8,"item_padding":20},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_1eda252_LRjdnA"],"name":"FAQ","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_a